# Elite Trade FX

Vite + React + TypeScript + Redux Toolkit + React Router + Tailwind. Do not switch this project to Next.js unless the user asks.

- `src/pages` are thin. Screens live in `src/containers`. Shared UI lives in `src/components`.
- Routes go through `src/router`. State goes through `src/store` slices.
- Design data stays in `src/data`.
- No `any`. No copied broker brands. Trading mocks must be labelled Demo / simulated.
- Node and MongoDB start in `BE/`. Do not add Postgres. Keep the API package inside `BE/`.
- Deploys go through GitHub Actions, not Vercel.
